# Wave T53 (Brightshore kit): glintpost — a panel-tech marker post: a slim dark post topped with a small tilted solar panel (amber frame, solar-blue face) catching one bright glint. The pair flanks the central avenue at the front street (12,5) + (15,5) — the approved painting's roadside panel posts at PANEL TECH JUNIPER's avenue. Fully opaque; the town grass is baked in at its measured colours (#2e8f12 flat / #2e5912 speckle — tg-sunnyshore's shipped render, NOT the TOWN_STYLE note). A POST WITH A PANEL HEAD: unlike Fenland's bogeyes (eyes at water level), Bridgeport's harbourbell (a bell on a frame), Rimefall's stonelantern (a stone lantern). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T53-BRIGHTSHORE-PLAN.md §5.)
